<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">$</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> ls</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> cpu/docker/</span></span>
